Explicit bounded development network effect after admission: read official PyPI release metadata and download the exact reviewed wheels from PyPI/files.pythonhosted.org, verify declared SHA-256, and install with hash checking only into `.cvf/runtime/personnel-import-20261108/build-venv`. No global upgrades, source distributions, arbitrary package execution or nonessential network access. Existing vulnerable setuptools78.1.0 is not the admitted build pin; use84.1.0 in the isolated Python3.11 environment. Build tools require Python>=3.10; source/runtime target remains Python3.9+ but only actual exercised versions may be claimed. No provider/network governance assertion is made. Freshness fetch by the canonical doctor remains confined to its public Core tracking-ref check.

