## Execution, budget and stop conditions

Root records independent accepted SPEC/ADR, complete PNI E1-E6 authority and exact action binding, actual six non-ACT control observations plus supplemental assessment, then requires successful fresh pre-dispatch and doctor. Before BUILD, workers rehydrate continuity and acknowledge the current handoff/action bytes. Root may commit reviewed dispatch documents to establish a baseline; that commit is not completion.

Terra runs focused owner/API/UI tests, Sol reader/packaging tests; then run the full noninteractive equivalent of CHAY_KIEM_THU.bat (all Python KIEM_THU*.py and all five existing JS groups plus new groups), source launcher smoke, worker-return, reviewer-fast and pre-commit. Preserve failed tests; do not hide/relabel skips. No worker may manually alter inherited gate files to make them pass.

After Astra accepts the source candidate, Root commits all candidate files/continuity on a clean tree. Sol builds from exactly that HEAD with the pinned isolated environment, preserves both clean-tree gates, stores artifacts in ignored paths, runs `cong_cu/KIEM_THU_KHOI.py --exe ... --commit <12-character-HEAD> --version 1.9.2`, then the full E6 headed flow. No unrelated untracked evidence file may be used to justify bypassing the clean build. Product findings repair within the same scope after consolidated triage; changed source requires a new reviewed candidate commit/build and affected reruns. Final evidence is written after build and separately committed. Root/Astra reassess exact terminal receipt when packet bytes/status/criteria change; an earlier action receipt never grants a different action.

Additional execution ceiling180minutes for combined implementation/tests/build/native verification, with supporting admission/review effort30minutes; prior planning/review cumulative time UNKNOWN. Stop at the ceiling, unresolved substantial design/identity change, real-data/effect/path escape, incompatible reader contract, failed required gate, unavailable headed environment or third same-root repair round without new cause. Retain partial evidence and apply the existing repair-convergence assessment before a dependent successor; do not rename work to reset cost. Routine same-scope issues are resolved by the assigned owner without operator reapproval. Ask only at an actual changed business/authority/effect boundary. No E6 or product COMPLETE claim if native proof cannot be obtained.

